{"id":"nc878ca3107","headline":"Indian GDP May Take A Hit Of 1% Point If War Continues In FY27, Anticipates EY Report","summary":"An EY Economy Watch report says India's economy may take a hit of up to 1 percentage point in FY27 if the West Asian war continues. Retail inflation could rise by an extra 1.5 points.","why":"India is a large oil importer, so prolonged Middle East conflict feeds into inflation, the current account and growth. Forecasts like this influence expectations for Reserve Bank of India policy and Indian equities.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"New Delhi","country":"India","lat":28.61,"lon":77.21,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/indian-gdp-may-take-a-hit-of-1-point-if-war-continues-in-fy27-anticipates-ey-report"},"sources":[{"name":"Free Press Journal","url":"https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/indian-gdp-may-take-a-hit-of-1-point-if-war-continues-in-fy27-anticipates-ey-report"}],"published_at":"2026-03-31T10:32:25Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"a48e613e76a01b13","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-17T18:10:56Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-03-31T10:32:25Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-03-31T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"IN","description_from":"publisher page metadata"},"image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/city-skyline-business-district-7092747.jpg","alt":"city skyline business district (illustration)","credit":"Leonhard_Niederwimmer","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/building-horizon-city-skyscraper-7092747/"}}